From fe38fbd5755acc75ffb296b9a1fad323ce32eb01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shahrokh <design@cariblanco.best>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:14:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] disk tier: --conversation-cache-spill-when-full
 (evict-oldest|reject) and --conversation-cache-spill-max-age-days (0 = off)

The GC's budget lever is now explicit: evict-oldest is the old behavior made a mode, reject refuses a spill over the budget and removes nothing. A separate age lever prunes conversations older than N days, oldest first, and is off by default (0 = no deletion by time at all). The scan still deletes nothing. conversation_spill_test: 102 checks.
---
 include/strata/core/conversation_spill.hpp | 28 ++++++++++---
 src/core/conversation_spill.cpp            | 44 +++++++++++++++++--
 src/core/conversation_spill_test.cpp       | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

